    "description": {
      "summary": "The caster emulates a revenant by siphoning blood from a target within reach",
      "value": "<p>The caster emulates a revenant by siphoning blood from a target within reach. The caster must make a melee touch attack, and if it hits, the target takes 4d6 points of shadow damage and the caster is healed for that much. This spell is considered non-elemental against undead and it works against undead unlike most draining abilities. Learned From Ghost Family, Parasite Grass, and Revenant</p>"
